- Use `Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization` for `[Authorize]` attribute in Client pages — add `@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization` to `_Imports.razor` if not present.

Do all of this work now. Create all files, modify existing files, run migrations, and verify the build succeeds.
